# Jak 3: the guns Jak mans on a vehicle (LIST-0.1.9 item 5; a tester: "vehicle turret section if 1st person you cant
# see anything", "still in jak 3"), run with JAKVR_TEST_TASK=65 (city-blow-tower: the pickup's gun, cam-bt-gun) or
# JAKVR_TEST_TASK=54 (desert-beast-battle: the Scorpion's gun, cam-scorpion-gun), JAKVR_STATE_TRACE=1. A new game into
# play (as jak3_shadow_walk.sim), the task's continue (he is put at the gun), then a picture every 400 frames: the head
# level, turned 40 degrees, and down 20, the left stick and the right pushed between them (the gun's aim) and the right
# trigger (its fire). Expect "state target-turret-stance", "[vr-view] a view from the game's own camera", "the view
# tipped N degrees down", "view in play: third person", and the pictures from the gun: the road or the desert ahead, the
# targets, no black and no inside of a model.
# A (Cross) every 200 frames from 3100 to 3500 closes the new game's save notice (it hid the view in sim pg).
# 0.1.9 (sim s09 vgbt, build 124): the task played only at frame 10500, after the new game's opening, and its levels
# were still loading at 13400: the same every 800 frames on to 18900.
